00:08:07.564 --> 00:08:09.765
&gt;&gt; Greg: THE PEOPLE WHO PUSH

00:08:09.766 --> 00:08:11.533
THEM ARE ALWAYS LIBERAL MEDIA.

00:08:11.534 --> 00:08:12.268
&gt;&gt; Juan: LET ME FINISH.

00:08:12.269 --> 00:08:14.336
&gt;&gt; Greg: I AM LETTING YOU

00:08:14.337 --> 00:08:15.371
FINISH.

00:08:15.372 --> 00:08:15.771
BREATHE IN.

00:08:15.772 --> 00:08:17.239
&gt;&gt; Juan: IF THE MEDIA HAD

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:18.974
IGNORE THIS STORY.

00:08:18.975 --> 00:08:21.477
I DON'T THINK THAN LOCAL SECTION

00:08:21.478 --> 00:08:22.344
OF "THE WASHINGTON POST"

00:08:22.345 --> 00:08:22.878
WOULD'VE COVERED IT.

00:08:22.879 --> 00:08:23.545
IF THE MAINSTREAM MEDIA HAD

00:08:23.546 --> 00:08:25.080
IGNORE THE FACT THAT THE RIGHT

00:08:25.081 --> 00:08:26.548
AND LEFT PICKED UP ON IT, THEN

00:08:26.549 --> 00:08:29.151
THEY WOULD SAY OH, MY GOSH.

00:08:29.152 --> 00:08:31.353
WHY IS THE MAINSTREAM MEDIA IS

00:08:31.354 --> 00:08:31.987
IGNORING THIS BIG STORY?

00:08:31.988 --> 00:08:33.555
BUT IN FACT, LET ME TELL YOU.

00:08:33.556 --> 00:08:38.560
TOMORROW NIGHT AM GOING TO WATCH

00:08:38.561 --> 00:08:39.929
A BASKETBALL GAME.

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:40.629
THE BLACK ISRAELITES WILL BE

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:41.597
THERE SAYING RUDE THINGS TO ME

00:08:41.598 --> 00:08:42.398
AND MY WIFE.

00:08:42.399 --> 00:08:44.366
THEY SAY THINGS TO EVERYBODY.

00:08:44.367 --> 00:08:45.968
PEOPLE DON'T STAND THERE AND

00:08:45.969 --> 00:08:46.302
ENGAGE.

00:08:46.303 --> 00:08:48.370
&gt;&gt; Greg: THE FIRST TIME THEY

00:08:48.371 --> 00:08:49.138
EVER SOLVE THEM.

00:08:49.139 --> 00:08:50.139
&gt;&gt; Jesse: THEY WERE WAITING

00:08:50.140 --> 00:08:51.740
FOR A BUS TO GO HOME.

00:08:51.741 --> 00:08:54.576
&gt;&gt; Greg: LET ME JUST SAY --

00:08:54.577 --> 00:08:56.512
&gt;&gt; Juan: THOSE KIDS STAYING

00:08:56.513 --> 00:08:59.682
THERE.

00:08:59.683 --> 00:09:00.282
HE IS STARING DOWN THE

00:09:00.283 --> 00:09:02.384
NATIVE AMERICAN GUY.

00:09:02.385 --> 00:09:04.386
&gt;&gt; Jesse: THE GUY GOT IN HIS

00:09:04.387 --> 00:09:04.687
FACE.

00:09:04.688 --> 00:09:08.123
WHAT DO YOU WANT TO DO?

00:09:08.124 --> 00:09:10.759
&gt;&gt; Juan: YOU HAVE FOUR OR FIVE

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:11.527
BLACK ISRAELITES.

00:09:11.528 --> 00:09:13.829
YOU HAVE BUSLOADS OF THESE KIDS.

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:15.397
SUDDENLY THEY ARE FEELING SO

00:09:15.398 --> 00:09:16.298
THREATENED.

00:09:16.299 --> 00:09:19.735
&gt;&gt; Jesse: YOU HAVE --

00:09:19.736 --> 00:09:20.402
&gt;&gt; Jedediah: YOU HAVE ADULTS

00:09:20.403 --> 00:09:22.604
AND CHILDREN.

00:09:22.605 --> 00:09:25.074
&gt;&gt; Juan: BASKETBALL GAMES.

00:09:25.075 --> 00:09:26.241
&gt;&gt; Greg: IF YOU WANT TO TALK

00:09:26.242 --> 00:09:28.411
ABOUT IT, THEY HAVE THESE

